  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What is BMR?",
      "a": "BMR (Basal Metabolic Rate) is the number of calories your body burns at complete rest to maintain vital functions like breathing, circulation, and cell production."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is TDEE?",
      "a": "TDEE (Total Daily Energy Expenditure) is your BMR multiplied by your activity level — the total calories you burn in a day including exercise."
    },
    {
      "q": "How does MacroMint adapt to Indian diets?",
      "a": "MacroMint's AI is trained on 500+ authentic Indian recipes across regional cuisines. It maps your macro targets to real dishes available in India — from ragi dosas to paneer tikka bowls — factoring in seasonal availability and budget."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the meals delivered fresh?",
      "a": "Yes! Ready-to-Eat meals are delivered within 20 minutes. Fresh Ingredient Kits (pre-portioned) are delivered within 9 minutes for home cooking."
